# Two players stand still on level 1 until player 1's bonus reaches 0 on its last life, as in two-players-zero-bonus. Player 2
# then skips the level with 40 bonus left. Upstream's shared zero_bonus (chuckie.c:18, :1157, :1169) makes the level-complete
# loop award nothing and then clears the flag, so level 2 starts with player 2's score still 0. The port pays the 40.
# See "Two quirks the port does not copy" in tools/parity/README.md.
players 2
level 1
8600 -
1 skip
20 -
